    <fields>
        <fullName>TR1__Accept_BHLO_Logs_from_Charm__c</fullName>
        <defaultValue>false</defaultValue>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>By default, Charm creates Debug Log records when processing a Monitor Bulk Job record with the Job Type of &quot;Contact Mass Update (BHTK)&quot; or &quot;Contact De-Sync&quot;. If this setting is enabled, Salesforce will expect Charm to create Log (TR1__BHLO_Log__c) records instead of Debug Log records.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>By default, Charm creates Debug Log records when processing a Monitor Bulk Job record with the Job Type of &quot;Contact Mass Update (BHTK)&quot; or &quot;Contact De-Sync&quot;. If this setting is enabled, Salesforce will expect Charm to create Log (TR1__BHLO_Log__c) records instead of Debug Log records.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Accept BHLO Logs from Charm</label>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Checkbox</type>
    </fields>
